        "en": "Communication is a primary grievance among dissatisfied clients. Several pet owners describe unreturned phone calls from practice managers, delayed lab results, and automated AI phone systems that make reaching a human difficult. Additionally, clients report feeling pressured into costly dental cleanings rather than discussing the primary health concern."
