        "en": "Despite front-office communication complaints, pet parents frequently emphasize the gentle medical handling of dogs and cats during in-person exams. Reviewers report positive experiences with acupuncture therapy, heartworm treatment, and sensitive end-of-life care for elderly pets. Animals are generally treated with warmth and dignity once inside the exam room."
      }
